{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0613"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge music-stage/theatre","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/music-stage__theatre.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",287],["+"," It was also at the Volksbühne that Christoph Schlingensief, born in Oberhausen in 1960, began his theatre career in 1993 with „100 Jahre CDU – Spiel ohne Grenzen“. The provocateur went on to stage actions such as his asylum-seeker container „Bitte liebt Österreich“ at the Wiener Festwochen in 2000 and directed „Parsifal“ in Bayreuth from 2004. Already ill with lung cancer, he laid the foundation stone of his Operndorf Afrika, an opera village near Ouagadougou in Burkina Faso, in February 2010; he died in Berlin on 21 August 2010."],["=",704]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",253],["+"," An der Volksbühne begann 1993 auch Christoph Schlingensief, 1960 in Oberhausen geboren, mit „100 Jahre CDU – Spiel ohne Grenzen“ seine Theaterlaufbahn. Der Provokateur inszenierte danach Aktionen wie seinen Asylbewerber-Container „Bitte liebt Österreich“ bei den Wiener Festwochen 2000 und ab 2004 den „Parsifal“ in Bayreuth. Bereits an Lungenkrebs erkrankt, legte er im Februar 2010 den Grundstein für sein Operndorf Afrika, ein Operndorf bei Ouagadougou in Burkina Faso; er starb am 21. August 2010 in Berlin."],["=",628]]}]},
{"seq":3,"at":"2026-10-21","kind":"corrected","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0613"},"reason":"a0613 (body, Berliner Ensemble): \"Brecht's model productions of \"Mutter Courage\" and \"Der kaukasische Kreidekreis\" were developed [at the Schiffbauerdamm]\" → \"Brecht staged his model production of \"Der kaukasische Kreidekreis\" that same year (1954)\". Why: Mutter Courage premiered in January 1949 at the Deutsches Theater, before the BE existed. Source: https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Berliner_Ensemble","by":"enrich batch 138","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-enrich/enrich-report/a0613-a0985.md","sources":[{"url":"https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Berliner_Ensemble"}]},
